ed","columns":35,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":33,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"lyric","text":"I think it's funny, she open up to me, get comfortable with me","columns":62,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":36,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":"Once I got it coming, I love her, she love me","columns":46,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":20,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":45,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":"I know that I'm nothing like someone the family want me to be","columns":61,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":16,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bm","column":58,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":"If I find a way, will you walk it with me?","columns":42,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":39,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"lyric","text":"Look at my face while you talking to me","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":39,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":"'Cause we only have one conversation a week","columns":43,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":25,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":39,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-28","kind":"lyric","text":"Can I get one conversation at least?","columns":38,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":36,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-29","kind":"lyric","text":"Shout out to everyone making my beats, you helping me preach","columns":60,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":39,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-30","kind":"lyric","text":"This music is the only thing keeping the peace when I'm falling to","columns":66,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":17,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":64,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-31","kind":"lyric","text":"Pieces","columns":6,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-32","kind":"lyric","text":"Look at the sky tonight, all of the stars have a reason","columns":56,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":13,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":55,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-33"